    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present No. 22 Oakdale Close to the market, a stunning three-bedroom family home located in the highly sought-after Ballycullen area.\n\nThis superb property is presented in excellent condition throughout and boasts a range of impressive features, including a modern fitted kitchen, upgraded bathrooms completed in 2022, high-quality flooring, tasteful décor, Stira access to the attic, and Climote control for the gas-fired central heating. The bright and spacious accommodation is ideally suited to modern family living.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a comfortable living room, kitchen, spacious dining area ideal for entertaining, and a downstairs guest W.C. Upstairs, there are three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with ensuite, along with a contemporary family bathroom.\n\nExternally, the property further impresses with a large, private rear garden enjoying a sunny orientation and secure walled boundaries, making it ideal for outdoor dining and family use. To the front, there is off-street parking for two cars, in close proximity to the property is a large green area, providing a wonderful open space that is perfect for children to play.\n\nOakdale Close is a mature and highly regarded development, offering a peaceful setting away from the hustle and bustle while enjoying expansive views of the Dublin Mountains. The location provides the perfect balance of tranquillity and convenience, with a wide range of shopping centres, primary and secondary schools, parks and excellent access to the M50 motorway network all nearby. The area is also well served by public transport, with numerous bus routes providing easy access to Dublin City Centre.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\n3d tour - \nhttps://my.matterport.com/show/?m=8RyzJ5St8yj\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Exceptional 3-bed semi-detached property in superb condition throughout circa 103sqm</li><li> 3 bathrooms with contemporary design</li><li> High quality floors throughout</li><li> Sunny rear garden with low maintenance</li><li> Composite front door</li><li> Highly efficient Ber rating (C)</li><li> Gas fire central heating and DG windows</li><li> Off street parking</li><li> Walkable amenities and green spaces</li><li> Mature and settled area with stunning scenic views of the Dublin Mountains</ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
